# The friends' partner icons, made from each friend's own textures on the player's disc (RECIPES.md).
# Shown in the partner's place while a friend is in the party (sl_assets_aurora.c, portIconTexOverride).
#
# Each friend is put together at the disc's own size from his model's cards (as the model stands:
# the body, then what's on it), cut to its outline, scaled into the icon with the texel look kept,
# and given a 1-texel line in his own line colour. The forms are the game's partner icons':
#   _hud   48x48, as ICON_1A4 (Goombella's; Koops ICON_1A5 ...): the figure low on the left, the HP
#          heart (ICON_19F, the game's own, scaled to the HUD's) behind it at the top right, the pair cut
#          out as one sticker: a white border, a grey rim and a dark grey shadow one texel down and right,
#          as the game's
#   _menu  40x40, as ICON_155 (Goombella's standing): the whole friend, no border
# The drawn icons at the same paths stand in where the disc can't make them (`fallback`).

mask solid alpha

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Blooey: his one card (c_lp_gesso 0); the HUD
image art/icons/blooey/blooey_hud.png
  fallback art/icons/blooey/blooey_hud.png
  canvas 48 48
  piece heart icon ICON_19F
  @heart crop 2 3 36 33
  @heart scale 22 20 texel
  paste heart 22 4
  piece fig canvas 128 144
  piece body model c_lp_gesso 0
  @fig paste body 0 0
  @fig crop 3 4 121 136
  @fig scale 29 33 texel
  @fig grow 1 #392821
  paste fig 4 9
  grow 1 #e7e7e7
  grow 1 #a5a5a5
  piece sticker copy
  piece shadow copy
  @shadow fill in solid #424242
  canvas 48 48
  paste shadow 1 1
  paste sticker 0 0
  alpha cut 128
end

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Blooey: his one card (c_lp_gesso 0); the menus
image art/icons/blooey/blooey_menu.png
  fallback art/icons/blooey/blooey_menu.png
  canvas 40 40
  piece fig canvas 128 144
  piece body model c_lp_gesso 0
  @fig paste body 0 0
  @fig crop 3 4 121 136
  @fig scale 32 36 texel
  @fig grow 1 #392821
  paste fig 3 1
  alpha cut 128
end

